<title>UK: Kvaerner plans unchanged 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Kvaerner plans unchanged 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian shipping, engineering and construction group Kvaerner ASA said on Tuesday it planned to pay a dividend of 6.5 crowns per share for 1996, unchanged from 1995.</p>
<p>The company said earlier on Tuesday pretax profit for 1996 dropped to 750 million crowns from 2.44 billion in 1995. It said profits were unlikely to improve until the second half of the year.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
